    "1 回ためせる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try once"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 回の購入で、ファミリー共有にも対応。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One purchase, shared with Family Sharing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 回遊ぶと、首の動いた角度がここに描かれます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play once and your neck's range will be drawn here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 年の記録と週ごとのグラフ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A year of records and weekly charts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 年分は Pro": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full year with Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24 コースすべて": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All 24 courses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro にする": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro のコース": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro course"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro を使っています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro を見る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See Pro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone を両手で持ち、首といっしょに傾けて": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold your iPhone in both hands and tilt it with your head"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone を机に立てて、首をゆっくり倒す・うなずく・ふり向く。その動きで、風船が雲の輪へ流れていきます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stand your iPhone on the desk, then slowly tilt, nod and turn your head. The balloon drifts with you into the cloud rings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone を目の高さに立てて、顔が映る位置で": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stand your iPhone at eye level so it can see your face"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと少し。痛くないところまで": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A little more, only as far as is comfortable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは購入できません。通信を確かめて、あとでもう一度開いてください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Purchases aren't available right now. Check your connection and try again later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "うなずく": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nod"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おかえりなさい。今日の 1 分から、また。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome back. Start again with today's minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "おつかれさま": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nicely done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お知らせ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reminders"
          }
        }
      }
    },
