    "この 7 日": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last 7 days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この 7 日はまだ遊んでいません。今日の 1 分で、首の角度が描かれます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No sessions in the last 7 days. Today's minute will draw your neck's range."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この iPhone ではカメラで遊べません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera play isn't available on this iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリについて": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリは医療機器ではありません。症状の改善を約束するものではありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app is not a medical device and makes no promise to relieve symptoms."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そのまま %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
