      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold it, 5 seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "なぎ（90 点以上）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calm (90+)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ななめ・回す・夜の雲など、Pro の 16 コース。毎日の 1 分が全コースから選ばれます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "16 Pro courses with diagonals, circles and night clouds. Today's minute picks from every course."
          }
        }
      }
    },
