        }
      }
    },
    "閉じる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sound"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音と振動": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sound & Haptics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顔が見えません。iPhone を目の高さに立ててください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't see your face. Stand your iPhone at eye level"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顔の向きは iPhone の中だけで計算し、映像は保存も送信もしません。カメラを使わず、傾けたり指でなぞったりしても遊べます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Head angles are calculated on your iPhone; video is never saved or sent. You can also play without the camera by tilting the phone or using your finger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顔の向きは iPhone の中だけで計算します。カメラの映像は保存も送信もしません。記録はこの iPhone の中だけに残ります。アカウント・広告・解析はありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Head angles are calculated on your iPhone. Camera video is never saved or sent. Your records stay on this iPhone. No accounts, ads or analytics."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顔の向きを読むためだけにカメラを使います（映像は保存も送信もしません）。許可しなくても、iPhone を傾けるか、指でなぞって同じコースを遊べます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera is used only to read your head angle (video is never saved or sent). Without it, you can play the same course by tilting your iPhone or dragging with your finger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "風が乱れた秒数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seconds of wind"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首で、風船を運ぶ。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steer a balloon with your neck."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首の 1 分を、毎日ちがう空で。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A neck minute under a new sky every day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首の動いた範囲": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neck range"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首の動いた角度が、週ごとにどう広がったかを見られます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See how your neck's range widens week by week."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
